==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|hvíla|lang=non}}, akin to {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰𐌽|sc=Goth|tr=ƕeilan||to pause, cease|lang=got}}, from {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰|sc=Goth|tr=ƕeila||hour|lang=got}}, akin to {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|hwila||a while|lang=goh}} (or {{term|wila||lang=goh}} or {{term|hwil|lang=goh}}), compare German {{term|Weile|lang=de}}.

===Verb===
'''hvíla'''

# to [[rest]]

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-1|hvíl}}

